<title>UK: World Bank sets 200 mln rand three-year bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets 200 mln rand three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN RAND  COUPON     14.625    MATURITY    19.JUN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.2125  PAY DATE    19.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	REOFFER    99.90     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/SA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.3125    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUD OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
